cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Three-body integrator operating envelope: research code"
abstract: >-
  Research code for a comparison of fixed-step leapfrog, time-symmetric adaptive
  leapfrog and IAS15 across analytical, binary-single and Sun-Earth-Moon
  three-body configurations, together with the chaos-appropriate diagnostic panel
  used to judge them.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gupta
    given-names: Aarush
    affiliation: "UWCSEA East, Singapore"
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
keywords:
  - three-body problem
  - symplectic integration
  - time-symmetric adaptation
  - numerical stability
  - N-body diagnostics

